gcc-4.4: Miscompilation at -O2 on alpha
http://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=566195

When I checked earlier this year it was still present in gcc-4.4 but was
fixed in gcc-4.5.

I'm not particularly hopeful that it is the issue causing problems in
large C++ package builds.

Cheers
Michael.



